# Copy to .env for local server development. Never commit the real .env file
# (it's already in .gitignore). No production secrets belong in this repo —
# production values are set in your hosting provider's environment/secret
# manager (see docs/ARCHITECTURE.md and docs/SYNC_PROTOCOL.md).

# Postgres connection string for `prisma/schema.prisma`. Example shape only —
# not a real credential.
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/gsh_dev"

# Session token signing — required once server/services/auth.ts is wired to a
# real HTTP layer. Generate your own random value; do not reuse this example.
SESSION_SECRET="replace-with-a-long-random-value"

# NOT read by the current client build. The client preview still has a
# manually-entered Sync Server URL field (More → Sync status) — baking a fixed
# production URL into the build via this variable instead is flagged as
# outstanding work, not yet implemented. See docs/SYNC_PROTOCOL.md.
# SYNC_SERVER_URL="https://your-gsh-server.example.com"
